                                "example_id": "d8331167-2184-4620-a732-831903fefee6",
                                "sense_id": "8445d229-150a-3769-9130-60395ba2bb78",
                                "text": "Henri, lord of Nassau-Breda: a member of the Golden Fleece who would joust alongside Philip and then host lavish banquets and after-parties that lasted ‘well nigh the whole night’ […]."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
